<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">- TarifitLS</book>
  <para style="h">Ayṯ-Filippi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Flp</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ayṯ-Filippas</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ṯabrat n arrasul Bulus ɣar Ayṯ-Filippi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ṯabrat n arrasul Bulus ɣar Ayṯ-Filippi</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1" />
  <para style="s">Lmuqaddima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1" />Nec ḏ Bulus akiḏi Timutawus neccin ḏ ixeddamen n Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <char style="it">Ntari ṯabrat-a </char> i ṣṣaliḥin n Ƹisa Lmasiḥ iy iǧan ḏi ṯendint n Filippi ḏ arruyas nsen ḏ nnuyab nsen. <verse eid="PHP 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2" />Akiḏwem yiȓi arḍa ḏ ȓehna zi Arebbi Babaṯneɣ ḏ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ Siḏiṯneɣ.<verse eid="PHP 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ccuker ḏ dduƹaʼ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3" />Tcekkareɣ Arebbi kuȓ ṯwaȓat xmi ḏaywem tfekkareɣ. <verse eid="PHP 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4" />Kur ṯwaȓat tẓaǧiɣ xawem ḏi ṯẓaǧiṯ inu s yijjen n ȓefraḥeṯ ḏ ṯameqqrant <verse eid="PHP 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5" />ȓaḥeqqac ṯcarrcem akiḏi ḏi Lʼinjil zi nhar amezwaru aȓ ȓexxu. <verse eid="PHP 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6" />Nec aqayi mteyyqen ḏi ṯmesȓayṯ-a: Wenni ig ibḏan ḏaywem ca n ccɣeȓ ḏ aṣebḥan axas itsiɣi axas itkemmaȓ ḥetta aȓ Nhar nni n Ƹisa Lmasiḥ.<verse eid="PHP 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7" />Ɣari ȓḥaqq aḏaywem fekkareɣ amenni ȓaḥeqqac aqa kenniw ɣari ḏeg wuȓ inu. Aqa marra ṯcarrcem akiḏi ḏi arḍa <char style="it">n ȓxeḏmeṯ-a</char> waxxa aqayi ḏi ȓeḥbes niɣ tḏafaƹeɣ x Lʼinjil ḏ ȓḥaqq iy ḏayes. <verse eid="PHP 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8" />Ataf Arebbi ḏ ccaheḏ inu mecḥaȓ iy kenniw tweḥḥaceɣ s lḥanana n Ƹisa Lmasiḥ.<verse eid="PHP 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9" />Ḏ ṯanita ḏ ṯẓaǧiṯ inu ataf aḏ tarni ȓemḥibbeṯ nwem ktar u ktar bac aḏ tessnem marra aḏ tmeyyzem marra. <verse eid="PHP 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10" />Ḥima aḏ tixḍarem min iǧan ḏ aṣebḥan ḥima aḏ tiȓim ṯeṣfam bȓa ȓƹib ɣar nhar n Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="PHP 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11" />Zzayes zi Ƹisa Lmasiḥ aḏ tiȓim ṯƹemmarem s min d itarwen ȓḥaqq. <char style="it">Marra</char> manaya i lƹaḍama n Arebbi ḏ lḥamd nnes.<verse eid="PHP 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lʼinjil yarenni waxxa ḥebbsen arrasul Bulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12" />Ay ayṯma rezzuɣ aḏ tessnem min ḏayi iweqƹen, manayenni ḏ ṣṣaḥ ixeddem i Lʼinjil bac aḏ itentacar. <verse eid="PHP 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13" />Nec lḥala inu ṯeḏweȓ maƹrufa jar marra ȓƹaskar n ȓeqṣar ḏ marra iwḏan iƹni nec aqayi ḏi ȓeḥbes ƹlaḥsab Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="PHP 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14" />X ssabab n snaseȓ-a inu azyen ameqqran n ayṯma twacejjƹen bac aḏ ssiwȓen s wawaȓ n Arebbi s yijjen n zƹameṯ ḥsen zi qbeȓ bȓa ṯiggwḏi.<verse eid="PHP 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15" />Ḏ ṣṣaḥ ḏinni ȓebƹaḍ tbeccaren s Lmasiḥ s ȓeḥseḏ ḏ lƹadawa, u ḏinni ȓebƹaḍ tbeccaren nican s ȓxaḍar nsen. <verse eid="PHP 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16" />Yina tbeccaren s ȓemḥibbeṯ nsen wami ssnen twaxḍareɣ bac aḏ dafƹeɣ x Lʼinjil. <verse eid="PHP 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17" />Yinni nneɣni lla, tbeccaren s Lmasiḥ s lʼananiya maci s wuȓ nsen iṣfa, rezzun aḏayi ggen lmacakil wami ǧiɣ ḏi ȓeḥbes. <verse eid="PHP 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18" />Walakin maƹlic, s ṯnayen n ibriḏen-a Lmasiḥ itwabeccar. Ḏ manayenni iy iǧan muhim waxxa s wuȓ iy iǧan ḏ aɣeddar niɣ s wuȓ iy iǧan iṣfan. U s manayenni iy zi farḥeɣ nec.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHP 1:18">Wah, aḏ qqimeɣ nec farrḥeɣ. <verse eid="PHP 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19" />Liʼanna ssneɣ xmi tettarem xafi i Arebbi ḏ Arruḥ n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ itƹawan-ayi ataf min ḏayi itewqiƹen aḏ iḏweȓ ḏ asefȓeṯ inu. <verse eid="PHP 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20" />Trajiɣ s wur inu nec tmenniɣ war tseḏḥiɣ ca qaƹ <char style="it">x lwajib inu</char>. Lla, nec tzeƹƹameɣ ȓexxu aḏ zeƹmeɣ menbaƹd bac s ddat inu azzayes imɣar Lmasiḥ waxxa aḏ mmṯeɣ niɣ aḏ ddareɣ. <verse eid="PHP 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21" />Minzi ɣari Lmasiḥ netta ḏ ṯuḏarṯ inu, ɣari ȓmewṯ nettaṯ ḏ ljaʼiza inu. <verse eid="PHP 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22" />Meȓa qqimeɣ ddareɣ s ddat-a inu, ataf aḏ arniɣ mliḥ ḏi ȓxeḏmeṯ inu. Walakin nec war ssineɣ ca min ɣa ixḍareɣ. <verse eid="PHP 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23" />Ȓexxu aqayi jar ṯnayen n ṯmesȓayin-a iy ɣa ixḍareɣ. Ḏayi mizȓi aḏ uyureɣ <char style="it">zi ṯuḏarṯ-a</char> aḏ iȓiɣ ak Lmasiḥ ȓaḥeqqac manaya qaƹ ḥsen zi marra. <verse eid="PHP 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24" />Walakin labud ḥsen i kenniw meȓa qqimeɣ <char style="it">ddareɣ</char> s ddat-a inu. <verse eid="PHP 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25" />Aqayi teyyqeɣ s lwajib-a inu ssneɣ aḏ qqimeɣ aḏ siɣiɣ ḏanita akiḏwem bac aḏ tarnim ḏi lʼiman azzayes ṯfarḥem. <verse eid="PHP 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26" />Aɣarwem d ƹeqbeɣ ƹaweḏ. X ssabab-a ataf ȓefraḥeṯ nwem ḏi Ƹisa Lmasiḥ aḏ d tenfeyyeḍ ƹlaḥsab nec.<verse eid="PHP 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27" />Lmuhim, suyureṯ ixef nwem ḏeg yijjen n ubriḏ iticcen lqima i Lʼinjil n Lmasiḥ. Ṯumma waxxa nec usiɣ-d akenniw ẓreɣ niɣ ɣabeɣ xawem ataf axawem sȓeɣ ȓexbar belli ṯuggurem nican x yijjen n array, ṯxeddmem fus ḏeg ufus x ssabab n lʼiman iy iǧan ḏi Lʼinjil, <verse eid="PHP 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28" />ƹaweḏ war teggwḏem ca qaƹ zeg yinni iy ḏawem itƹarraḍen. Manaya iy teggem aɣarsen ṯiȓi ḏ ijjen n lƹalama iy d isbeyyanen mliḥ niṯni aḏ fnan kenniw aḏ tnejmem. Marra manaya aḏ d yas zi Arebbi. <verse eid="PHP 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29" />Maci ƹlaḥsab Lmasiḥ azzayes ṯamnem waha; Lla, labud ƹaweḏ aḏ twaƹeddbem ƹlaḥsab ssabab nnes. <verse eid="PHP 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30" />Minzi kenniw tmenɣam ḏeg umenɣi nni iy ḏi tuɣa tmenɣiɣ nec u ƹaḏ tesȓim belli tmenɣiɣ ḏayes.<verse eid="PHP 1:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2" />
  <para style="s">Array nneɣ aḏ iḏweȓ am array n Lmasiḥ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1" />Meȓa kenniw twacejjƹem s Lmasiḥ niɣ ṯethillam ḏi ȓemḥibbeṯ nnes niɣ ṯcarrcem ak Arruḥ nnes, niɣ ṯufim ḏayes arraḥmeṯ ḏ lḥanana, <verse eid="PHP 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2" />ataf itxeṣṣa aḏ tkemmȓem i ȓefraḥeṯ inu aɣarwem yiȓi array ḏ ijjen ḏ ȓemḥibbeṯ ḏ icten, kenniw aḏ tiȓim ḏ ijjen aɣarwem ṯiȓi ijjen n lfikra. <verse eid="PHP 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3" />War teggem walu zi lʼananiya niɣ zi ttakebbur. Bȓa ttakebbur weqqarem inneɣni ḥsen zeg yixef nwem. <verse eid="PHP 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4" />Itxeṣṣa kuȓ ijjen zzaywem war ixezzar ca min ṯ ithiman waha. Itxeṣṣa-ṯ ƹaweḏ aḏ ixzar min ithiman i yinneɣni.<verse eid="PHP 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5" />Array nwem itxeṣṣa aḏ yiȓi am array n Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="PHP 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6" />Netta aqaṯ ḏ ṣṣifeṯ n Arebbi, walakin wami imqudda ak Arebbi war inwi ca aḏ iṭṭef ḏi manayenni. <verse eid="PHP 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7" />Lla, netta yarra ixef nnes ḏ walu iṭṭef ijjen n ṣṣifeṯ am yismeɣ, iƹni ixȓeq-d am ṣṣifeṯ n bnaḏem. <verse eid="PHP 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8" />Wami d imeḍhar am ṣṣifeṯ n yijjen n bnaḏem, isehwa-d ixef nnes iṭaƹ ḥetta wami immuṯ ijjen n ȓmewṯ ḏi ṣṣalib. <verse eid="PHP 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9" />X manayenni isgaƹƹeḏ-iṯ Arebbi ɣar ujenna qaƹ, igga-as isem nni iy iǧan ḏeg ujenna x yisemawen marra. <verse eid="PHP 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10" />Bac x yisem nni n Ƹisa aḏ rekƹen marra x ifadden nsen, yinni iǧan ḏeg ujenna ḏ yinni iǧan ḏi ṯmurṯ ḏ yinni iǧan swadday n ṯmurṯ. <verse eid="PHP 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11" />Aḏ iƹtaref kuȓ yiȓes aḏ yini x Ƹisa Lmasiḥ qa netta ḏ Siḏiṯneɣ azzayes isemɣar Arebbi Babaṯneɣ.<verse eid="PHP 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iȓiṯ am yiṯran n ujenna ireqqen x ṯmurṯ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12" />Iḏen ay imƹizzen inu, mamc tuɣa ṯetṭaƹam ȓebda zi qbeȓ wami tuɣayi akiḏwem, amenni ƹaweḏ iy ɣa ḏayi ṯṭaƹem wami xawem ɣabeɣ. Iƹni aḏ teqqimem teggem lmejhud bac aḏ tkemmȓem mliḥ ḏeg usenjem nwem s yijjen n ṯiggwḏi ḏ yijjen n tarjiji. <verse eid="PHP 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13" />Minzi ḏ Arebbi ig isxeddamen array nwem ḏ ȓexḏayem nwem bac aḏ teggem lɣaraḍ nnes ḏ aṣebḥan.<verse eid="PHP 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14" />Ggeṯ marra ṯimesȓayin bȓa ma aḏ tceṯcam bȓa ma aḏ tmenɣem. <verse eid="PHP 2:14" /><verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15-16" />Ammu aḏ tiȓim beriʼin bȓa ȓƹib ḏi ȓwesṭ n yiwḏan n ȓweqṯ-a iƹewwjen ixarewḍen. Ḏaysen iy ṯreqqem am yiṯran ḏi ddunect-a xmi ḏasen tqeddamem awaȓ n ṯuḏarṯ. Amenni aḏ ftaxareɣ ḏi Nhar nni n Lmasiḥ nec war uzziȓeɣ ca war xḏimeɣ ca ḏi ȓxawi waha. <verse eid="PHP 2:15-16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17" />Nec farrḥeɣ akiḏwem s yijjen n ȓefraḥeṯ maƹlic meȓa ferrɣen-ayi-d waha am yijjen n ṣṣeḏqeṯ n iḏammen x dbiḥeṯ nwem iy tqeddamem kenniw s lʼiman nwem. <verse eid="PHP 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18" />Amenni ƹaweḏ uȓa ḏ kenniw itxeṣṣa akiḏi ṯfarḥem s yijjen n ȓefraḥeṯ.<verse eid="PHP 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arrasul Bulus itweṣṣa x Timutawus ḏ Parfulitus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19" />Tmenniɣ s Ƹisa Lmasiḥ aḏawem d ssekkeɣ Timutawus ḏeɣya bac xmi ḏayi d ɣa yarr ȓexbar xawem aḏayi isfareḥ. <verse eid="PHP 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20" />War ɣari <char style="it">ḏa</char> ḥadd am netta thima-ṯ lḥala nwem. <verse eid="PHP 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21" />Marra rezzun min ḏasen ithiman i yixef nsen waha, maci min ithiman i Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="PHP 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22" />Amma Timutawus netta ṯessnem-ṯ meltazem s yixef nnes, ixeddem akiḏi ḏi Lʼinjil am yijjen n uḥarmuc ixeddem ak babas. <verse eid="PHP 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23" />X manaya, tmenniɣ aḏawem ṯiḏ ssekkeɣ walakin trajiɣ aḏ ẓȓeɣ mamc ɣa ƹḏunt lmacakil inu. <verse eid="PHP 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24" />U nec aqayi mteyyqen ḏi Siḏiṯneɣ aɣarwem d aseɣ ḏeɣya uȓa ḏ nec.<verse eid="PHP 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25" />Cuf, twaȓiɣ labud aḏawem d arreɣ uma Parfulitus wenni iy kiḏi itemƹacaren am ca n umjaheḏ. Netta ḏ amsexxar nwem wenni iy ḏayi d ṯessekkem bac aḏayi ithilla. <verse eid="PHP 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26" />Itweḥḥac-ikenniw aṭṭas marra iḏwem, iysi xawem amnus ƹaweḏ wami d ṯarrim ȓexbar tuɣa ihȓec. <verse eid="PHP 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27" />Wah, tuɣa ihȓec ḏ ṣṣaḥ. Tuɣa ƹȓayen immuṯ walakin Arebbi irḥem-iṯ. War iǧi ca netta waha, irḥem-ayi uȓa ḏ nec bac war xafi itmarni ȓhemm x ȓhemm. <verse eid="PHP 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28" />X manayenni aḏawem ṯiḏ ssekkeɣ ȓexxu ḏ abriḏ bac aḏ tfarḥem xmi ṯ ɣa ṯeẓrem u ƹaweḏ war ḏayi itiȓi bu umnus. <verse eid="PHP 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29" />Reḥḥbem-ṯ s Siḏiṯneɣ s yijjen n ȓefraḥeṯ ḏ ṯameqqrant, weqqareṯ iryazen am netta. <verse eid="PHP 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30" />Mayemmi? Tuɣa ƹȓayen immuṯ ƹlaḥsab ȓxeḏmeṯ n Lmasiḥ minzi iɣamar s ṯuḏarṯ nnes wami irzu aḏ ixḏem min war ṯzemmarem ca aḏ txeḏmem kenniw zi lwajib nwem ɣari.<verse eid="PHP 2:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3" />
  <para style="s">A nemṣȓaḥ ak Arebbi s Ƹisa Lmasiḥ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1" />Ȓexxu ay ayṯma aḏ kemmȓeɣ, farḥeṯ s Siḏiṯneɣ! War ɣari bu lmuckil aḏawem ƹawḏeɣ ṯimesȓayin-a s ṯira, kenniw ƹaweḏ azzaysent twaḥḍam zi lxaṭar.<verse eid="PHP 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2" />Ḥḍam ixef nwem zeg iqzinen nni, iƹni iryazen nni iteggen ccarr itḥejjamen i bnaḏem. <verse eid="PHP 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3" />Cuf, ḏ neccin ig iǧan ḏ ṭṭahareṯ nni n ṣṣaḥ. Iƹni nƹebbeḏ s Arruḥ n Arebbi, ɣir nteftaxar s Ƹisa Lmasiḥ, war netriji ca aȓ lḥasanat nneɣ. <verse eid="PHP 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4" />Iwa uȓa ḏ nec ɣari ssabab aḏ rajiɣ aȓ lḥasanat inu zaƹma. Meȓa ḏinni can yijjen ɣares ssabab aḏ iraja aȓ lḥasanat nnes, ataf nec ɣari ktar zzayes. <verse eid="PHP 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5" />Mayemmi? Nec ṭehhareɣ nhar wis ṯmeniyyam. Lʼaṣel inu zi Ayṯ-Israʼil zi Ayṯ-Benyamin. Nec ḏ aƹibrani mmis n iƹibraniyen. Ƹlaḥsab ccariƹa, nec zi ȓḥizeb nni n ifarrisiyen. <verse eid="PHP 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6" />Ƹlaḥsab zƹameṯ inu nec tuɣa tƹeddabeɣ jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin n Lmasiḥ. Ƹlaḥsab lqawanin iy iǧan ḏi ccariƹa tuɣayi s bȓa ȓƹib.<verse eid="PHP 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7" />Walakin x ssabab n Lmasiḥ min ḏayi ineffƹen qbeȓ, ȓexxu ḥessbeɣ-ṯ ḏ ṯaxṣarṯ. <verse eid="PHP 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8" />Ḏ ṣṣaḥ ḥessbeɣ ṯimesȓayin-a qaƹ ḏ ṯaxṣarṯ x ssabab n lqima ṯameqqrant bac aḏ ssneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ netta ḏ Siḏi. X ssabab nnes iy xṣareɣ ṯimesȓayin-a qaƹin, ḥesbeɣ-ṯent ḏ zzbeȓ bac aḏ rebḥeɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="PHP 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9" />Ḥima aḏayi afen ḏayes bȓa ca n ṣṣulḥ ak Arebbi iy d itasen zzayi nec waha ƹlaḥsab ccariƹa. Lla, ṣṣulḥ nni inu ak Arebbi itas-d s lʼiman inu zi Lmasiḥ, iƹni ṣṣulḥ nni itas-d zi Arebbi itas-d s lʼiman. <verse eid="PHP 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10" />Rezzuɣ aḏ ssneɣ Lmasiḥ ḏ jjheḏ nnes wami d ikkar zi ȓmewṯ. Aḏ ssneɣ ƹaweḏ ṯamƹacarṯ nni xmi ɣa ncarec akiḏes s uƹeddeb nni iy xas ikkin netta, a neḏweȓ amecnaw netta s ȓmewṯ nnes. <verse eid="PHP 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11" />Amenni mamec ma igga, nec aḏ afeɣ Yum Lqiyama aḏ yiȓi inu.<verse eid="PHP 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yallaheṯ a nḥawȓeṯ bac a neṭṭef min nrezzu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12" />War iǧi ca ṣafi ṭṭfeɣ marra ṯimesȓayin nni niɣ ṣafi war ḏayi bu ca n ȓƹib; Lla, nec ƹaḏ tḥawaȓeɣ aḏ ṭṭfeɣ ṯimesȓayin nni iy zi ḏayi iṭṭef Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="PHP 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13" />Ay ayṯma, war ḥessbeɣ ca ṣafi ṭṭfeɣ qaƹ ṯimesȓayin nni. Walakin ḏinni ijjen n ṯmesȓayṯ teggeɣ-t: Tettuɣ min iteƹqaben ɣar ḏeffar, teggeɣ lmejhud inu ɣar min d igguren ɣar zzaṯ. <verse eid="PHP 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14" />Tḥawaȓeɣ x manayenni iy xef rezzuɣ bac aḏ rebḥeɣ ljaʼiza nni iy zi ḏayi d iȓaɣa Arebbi ɣares ɣar ujenna s Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="PHP 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15" />Falihaḏa marra neccin ig itemɣuren <char style="it">ḏi lʼiman</char> itxeṣṣa a nfekkar amenni. Meȓa kenniw war ṯfekkarem ca amenni ḏ Arebbi iy kenniw ɣa isfehmen. <verse eid="PHP 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16" />Walakin min nessen ƹaḏ nican labud aḏayes neṭṭef mliḥ.<verse eid="PHP 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17" />Ay ayṯma, muneṯ ak yinni iteggen am nec. Xzareṯ mliḥ ɣar yinni igguren ḏeg ubriḏ nneɣ. <verse eid="PHP 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18" />Liʼanna ḏinni aṭṭas n yinni igguren ḏ ȓƹaḏyan x ṣṣalib n Lmasiḥ. Awaȓ-a nniɣ-awem-ṯ zi qbeȓ, ȓexxu tƹawaḏeɣ-awem-ṯ s imeṭṭawen inu. <verse eid="PHP 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19" />Aneggaru nsen aḏ itwamḥa. Arebbi nsen netta ḏ aƹeddis nsen. Semɣaren ixef nsen s ȓefḍayeḥ nsen. Ȓaƹquȓaṯ nsen nnuɣen ḏi ṯmesȓayin n ddunect-a. <verse eid="PHP 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20" />Neccin lla, ljinsiya nneɣ aqat ḏeg ujenna. Ssenni iy d ɣa yas wenni iy netraja iy ḏaneɣ ɣa isnejmen iƹni Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="PHP 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21" />Ddat nneɣ n ddunect-a at isbeddeȓ Lmasiḥ bac aḏ teḏweȓ am ddat nnes lƹaḍim. Itegg manaya s jjheḏ nni iy zi izemmar aḏ yarr qaƹ ṯimesȓayin swadday i lḥukem nnes.<verse eid="PHP 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1" />Iḏen ay ayṯma iy xafi iƹizzen iy tweḥḥaceɣ ig iǧan ḏ ȓefȓaḥeṯ inu ḏ ttaj inu, amenni labud itxeṣṣa aḏ teqqimem ṯbeddem ḏi Siḏiṯneɣ ay imƹizzen inu.<verse eid="PHP 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ȓuṣiyaṯ ṯineggura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2" />Tettareɣ i suyṯmaṯneɣ Ṯudya ḏ Ṯinticya bac aḏ yiȓi array nsent ḏ ijjen ak Siḏiṯneɣ. <verse eid="PHP 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3" />Wah, tettareɣ uȓa ḏ cek ay amƹacar inu n ṣṣaḥ, ƹawen ṯimɣarin-a iy kiḏi ixeddmen fus ḏeg ufus ḏi Lʼinjil, akiḏsent ƹaweḏ Krimu ḏ imƹacaren inu nneɣni. Isemawen nsen marra aqaṯen ḏi Lkitab n Ṯuḏarṯ.<verse eid="PHP 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4" />Farrḥeṯ ȓebda s Siḏiṯneɣ! Aḏawem iniɣ awaȓ-a ƹaweḏ, farrḥeṯ! <verse eid="PHP 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5" />Itxeṣṣa aḏ d imeḍhar ṣṣbar nwem i marra iwḏan, aqa Siḏiṯneɣ yuḏes-d. <verse eid="PHP 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6" />War kessim bu umnus x walu. S ṯẓaǧiṯ nwem ḏ dduƹaʼ nwem akiḏsen ccuker nwem aḏ tqeddmem marra ṯimesȓayin s ṭṭalabaṯ nwem i Arebbi. <verse eid="PHP 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7" />Ṯumma ȓehna n Arebbi ig itejhiḏen x marra ȓefhameṯ <char style="it">ḏi ddunect-a</char> ḏ wenni iy ɣa iḥḍan uȓawen nwem ḏ ȓaƹquȓaṯ nwem ḏi Ƹisa Lmasiḥ.<verse eid="PHP 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8" />Ɣar uneggaru ay ayṯma, min iǧan ḏ lḥaqiqa ḏ mindi iǧa ȓewqqar ḏ min iǧan iseggḏen ḏ min iǧan iṣfan ḏ min iǧan ḏ aṣebḥan ḏ min xaneɣ iƹizzen ḏ ayyi ṯamesȓayṯ ḏ ṯaṣebḥant aṭṭas aḏas nuc lqima itxeṣṣa kenniw aḏ tfekkarem ḏi ṯmesȓayin-a. <verse eid="PHP 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9" />Min ṯȓemḏem ḏ min ṯqebȓem zzayi ḏ min ṯesȓim ḏ min ṯeẓrim xafi itxeṣṣa u labud aḏ tesxeḏmem ṯimesȓayin-a. Ṯumma akiḏwem yiȓi Arebbi n ȓehna.<verse eid="PHP 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arrasul Bulus itcekkar ȓmuminin x lhadiyaṯ nsen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10" />Fa, mecḥaȓ farḥeɣ s Siḏiṯneɣ wami aȓ uneggaru ƹaweḏ tuɣa ṯzemmarem aḏayi ṯfeqḏem. Wah, tuɣa tfekkarem ḏayi qbeȓ walakin war ṯufim ca lfurṣa bac aḏayi ṯƹawnem. <verse eid="PHP 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11" />Awaȓ-a inu war iqqar ca rezzuɣ can ȓḥajeṯ; Lla, nec ȓemḏeɣ aḏ qenƹeɣ mammec ma ǧant ḍḍuruf inu. <verse eid="PHP 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12" />Ssneɣ aḏ ƹiceɣ ḏeg uzeyyar, ssneɣ ƹaweḏ aḏ ƹiceɣ ḏi ȓxir. Nec mamc ma ǧant ḍḍuruf inu ȓemḏeɣ ssir aḏ wajheɣ ȓxir niɣ ḏ jjuƹ, waxxa ɣari aṭṭas niɣ cwayt waha. <verse eid="PHP 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13" />Qaƹ ṯimesȓayin zemmareɣ-asent s wenni iy ḏayi iticcen jjheḏ. <verse eid="PHP 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14" />Walakin mliḥ wami ṯcarcem akiḏi ḏi lmacakil inu.<verse eid="PHP 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15" />A Ayṯ-Filippi, wami ffɣeɣ nec zi lʼiqlim n Masidunya ṯessnem qa ḏ kenniw waha zi marra ṯijumaƹ n ȓmuminin iy kiḏi icarcen ḏi lmuƹawana. Manayenni iwqeƹ wami yallah bḏiɣ tbeccareɣ s Lʼinjil ḏi jwayeh nni. <verse eid="PHP 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16" />Waxxa wami tuɣayi ḏi ṯendint n Salunik min ḥḏajeɣ ḏinni ṯessekkem-ayi-ṯ-id aṭṭas n ṯwaȓaṯin. <verse eid="PHP 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17" />Walakin nec war rezzuɣ ca aḏayi ṯucem ca n ȓḥajeṯ, nec rezzuɣ min ɣa yarnin ḏi lʼajar nwem <char style="it">ak Arebbi</char>. <verse eid="PHP 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18" />Ṭṭfeɣ ȓmuneṯ ṯekmaȓ zzaywem u ktar ƹaḏ. Ṯḏebbarem-ayi-d mliḥ wami qebȓeɣ zeg <char style="it">wumaṯneɣ</char> Parfulitus lhadiyaṯ nni iy ḏayi d ṯessekkem. Niṯenti am yijjen ṣṣeḏqeṯ ṯetfuḥ ḏ yijjen n dbiḥeṯ iy ɣa iqbeȓ Arebbi iy ḏas ɣa iƹejben. <verse eid="PHP 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19" />Aqa Arebbi inu aḏawem yuc qaƹ min ṯeḥḏajem ƹlaḥsab agȓa nnes lƹaḍim ḏi Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="PHP 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20" />Lƹaḍama i Arebbi Babaṯneɣ i ȓebda n ȓebdaṯ. Amin.<verse eid="PHP 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lxitam n ṯebrat-a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21" />Siwḍem sȓam i marra ṣṣaliḥin s Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. Awmaṯen iy iǧan akiḏi sawwaḍen-awem-d sȓam. <verse eid="PHP 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22" />Marra ṣṣaliḥiin sawwaḍen-awem-d sȓam xaṣṣatan yinni iǧan ḏi ṯeddarṯ n uzeǧiḏ Qayṣar.<verse eid="PHP 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23" />Aḏ yiȓi ak arruḥ nwem arḍa n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ.<verse eid="PHP 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4" />
</usx>